I think we should split things up if we are to continue this discussion. 
RSX and RT-11 works very differently, so it don't help if you try using 
RSX concepts and terms to describe RT-11 behavior.
RT-11 have file operations as a part of USR. There is only one USR, and 
all processes wanting to do any file operations have to go through USR, 
which is protected so that only a single process can enter it at a time.
Correct me if I'm wrong here.

RSX is doing things in a very different way. We can talk about the RSX 
way as well, separately, if you want to.

