It might be pointing out the obvious, but in RSX, when you open a file, 
or do whatever file operations, scheduling is still going on. So, not 
only can your program continue running while the file open is in 
progress, other programs will also be scheduled during this, and can 
have their file operations processed at the same time, as well as doing 
anything else.

