And yes, the Unix kernel is reentrant. You can have several processes 
doing and blocking on the same system call in parallel.

Since RSX don't really have the scenario at all, it isn't really helpful 
to talk about reentrancy in the RSX case. But as far as anything is 
concerned, most anything is reentrant in RSX.

But even bring that term up is a red herring.

