    performed and is good emulator test. Most sensible real PDP-11
    systems that would run RUST would have a boot rom. SimH and E11
    don't have it. But it's not enough of a test on its own (and I'm
    not sure about real 11/9x's).

3.  If a terminal output delay is present then it's probably an
